557
00:27:06.288 --> 00:27:10.657
&quot;Dengan badai, dia menyeberangi Laut Voroth

558
00:27:10.693 --> 00:27:15.130
&quot;Untuk mencapai pantai awan Raal,

559
00:27:15.164 --> 00:27:17.564
Di mana T&#x27;Para tua menawarkan kebenaran.&quot;

560
